==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns.
**6 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is not much harder than the previous stage. You will only need some [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Aliens]]. Units with long range and high damage (e.g. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]) are recommended, and [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] could help as well. Units with high health could be useful but they aren't mandatory. If you want, bring along some [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating units]] for the I.M. Phace and the Shy Boys.

[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] is a massive help because he can slow the progress of the enemies, especially the Shy Boys.

